This licence covers the source code in this repository only.

Paper titles, abstracts and full texts belong to their authors and are not
redistributed here. The app links to arXiv and renders content from arXiv at
runtime; the 1,000 bundled entries are metadata (title, abstract excerpt,
authors, category, date) taken from the arXiv API, which arXiv publishes for
reuse. See https://arxiv.org/help/api/tou and arXiv's own terms.
